  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nRare as hen’s teeth, and they’re not making any more land!\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are few and far between. Set in a sought-after Auckland seaside location, this substantial 1,404m² (more or less) site offers the space, setting and views that are increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nWake up to amazing sea views, enjoy the appeal of a coastal lifestyle and benefit from sought-after school zones: Rangitoto College and Murrays Bay Primary and Intermediate. \r\n\r\nAll services available.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking to build your dream home, explore the site’s potential or make a strategic investment for the future, the possibilities are yours to consider.\r\n\r\nLarge sites in premium seaside locations are a rare find. Here is your chance to secure a valuable piece of Auckland real estate and make the most of what it has to offer.\r\n\r\nThe land is here. The views are waiting. The opportunity is yours.",
